{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_043_deep_autoencoder-title\">Deep Autoencoder</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">逐层 RBM 生成式预训练初始化深层对称 encoder–decoder，再以全局重建误差微调非线性 bottleneck。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Layer-by-layer Restricted Boltzmann Machine (RBM) generative pretraining initializing a deep symmetric encoder–decoder fine-tuned via global reconstruction error.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">高维数据向量或展平图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">High-dimensional input vector or flattened image patch</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">低维 bottleneck 表征与输入重建</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Low-dimensional non-linear bottleneck code z and reconstructed input x̂</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://www.cs.toronto.edu/~hinton/papers.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_043_deep_autoencoder')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_043_deep_autoencoder')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Deep Autoencoder original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/10db81cefaccf99c2d0a.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_043_deep_autoencoder', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_043_deep_autoencoder\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_043_deep_autoencoder')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_043_deep_autoencoder', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_043_deep_autoencoder\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">高维输入 x</span><span class=\"lang-en\">input x</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">像素或其他连续/二值高维观测进入深层非线性压缩器。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests high-dimensional input vector or flattened image patch and prepares initial tensor representations (input x).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"像素或其他连续/二值高维观测进入深层非线性压缩器。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests high-dimensional input vector or flattened image patch and prepares initial tensor representations (input x).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"高维输入 x\" data-node-name-en=\"input x\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_043_deep_autoencoder', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">高维输入 x</span><span class=\"lang-en\">input x</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">像素或其他连续/二值高维观测进入深层非线性压缩器。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests high-dimensional input vector or flattened image patch and prepares initial tensor representations (input x).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从底到顶依次训练受限玻尔兹曼机，每层学习上一层表示的生成模型。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes RBM pretraining to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"逐层 RBM 预训练\" data-node-name-en=\"RBM pretraining\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_043_deep_autoencoder', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">逐层 RBM 预训练</span><span class=\"lang-en\">RBM pretraining</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从底到顶依次训练受限玻尔兹曼机，每层学习上一层表示的生成模型。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes RBM pretraining to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把输入投影到逐渐更窄的隐藏层，提取局部到抽象特征。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Encoder within the core layerwise pretrained symmetric bottleneck computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Encoder 下层\" data-node-name-en=\"Encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_043_deep_autoencoder', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Encoder 下层</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把输入投影到逐渐更窄的隐藏层，提取局部到抽象特征。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Encoder within the core layerwise pretrained symmetric bottleneck computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"继续压缩并为 bottleneck 提供初始化良好的深层表示。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Encoder within the core layerwise pretrained symmetric bottleneck computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Encoder 高层\" data-node-name-en=\"Encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_043_deep_autoencoder', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Encoder 高层</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">继续压缩并为 bottleneck 提供初始化良好的深层表示。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Encoder within the core layerwise pretrained symmetric bottleneck computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"网络最窄层是非线性降维坐标，也是供下游使用的 latent。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Code within the core layerwise pretrained symmetric bottleneck computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"低维 Code\" data-node-name-en=\"Code\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_043_deep_autoencoder', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">低维 Code</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Code</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">网络最窄层是非线性降维坐标，也是供下游使用的 latent。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Code within the core layerwise pretrained symmetric bottleneck computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将 encoder 权重展开为近似镜像解码路径并逐步扩维。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Decoder within the core layerwise pretrained symmetric bottleneck computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Decoder 高层\" data-node-name-en=\"Decoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_043_deep_autoencoder', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Decoder 高层</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将 encoder 权重展开为近似镜像解码路径并逐步扩维。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Decoder within the core layerwise pretrained symmetric bottleneck computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把高层 latent 细化回输入维度的重建表示。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Decoder within the core layerwise pretrained symmetric bottleneck computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Decoder 下层\" data-node-name-en=\"Decoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_043_deep_autoencoder', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Decoder 下层</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把高层 latent 细化回输入维度的重建表示。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Decoder within the core layerwise pretrained symmetric bottleneck computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"输出与输入同维度，度量模型保留的信息。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies reconstruction x̂ to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"重建 x̂\" data-node-name-en=\"reconstruction x̂\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_043_deep_autoencoder', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">重建 x̂</span><span class=\"lang-en\">reconstruction x̂</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">输出与输入同维度，度量模型保留的信息。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies reconstruction x̂ to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"以重建误差对展开后的整个 encoder–decoder 反向传播微调。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces low-dimensional non-linear bottleneck code z and reconstructed input x̂ via global Fine-Tune.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"全局 Fine-Tune\" data-node-name-en=\"global Fine-Tune\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_043_deep_autoencoder', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">全局 Fine-Tune</span><span class=\"lang-en\">global Fine-Tune</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">以重建误差对展开后的整个 encoder–decoder 反向传播微调。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces low-dimensional non-linear bottleneck code z and reconstructed input x̂ via global Fine-Tune.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Deep Autoencoder Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 深层自编码器以重建约束低维 bottleneck</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Non-Linear Bottleneck Manifold Compression via Reconstruction Minimization</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Deep Autoencoder：核心公式 · 深层自编码器以重建约束低维 bottleneck\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"43\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"21.744973pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.095689 -69.000129 197.979716 21.744973\" width=\"197.979716pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M3.417322-.551357L3.329978-.605947C2.964227-.262031 2.882342-.218359 2.767703-.218359C2.691278-.218359 2.62577-.262031 2.62577-.332998C2.62577-.436718 2.800457-1.064501 3.007898-1.670448L3.570173-3.701189L3.53742-3.728484C3.16075-3.668435 2.887801-3.635681 2.434705-3.602927L2.440164-3.510125C2.833211-3.499207 2.882342-3.48283 2.89326-3.368191C2.89326-3.357273 2.89326-3.346355 2.89326-3.340896C2.89326-3.280848 2.876883-3.231717 2.811375-2.986063L2.554803-2.09079C2.472918-2.320067 2.347362-2.407411 2.063495-2.407411C1.140927-2.407411 .060049-1.430253 .060049-.622324C.060049-.605947 .065508-.584111 .065508-.562275C.092803-.174687 .403965 .060049 .878896 .060049C1.375663 .060049 1.675907-.114639 2.134462-.660537C2.079872-.442177 2.063495-.343916 2.063495-.245654C2.063495-.223818 2.063495-.201982 2.068954-.174687C2.079872-.027295 2.210887 .070967 2.396493 .070967C2.707655 .070967 3.073406-.152851 3.417322-.551357ZM2.451082-1.970692C2.451082-1.937938 2.451082-1.905184 2.451082-1.87243C2.451082-1.064501 1.801464-.201982 1.162763-.201982C.906191-.201982 .731503-.343916 .715126-.562275C.715126-.584111 .709668-.605947 .709668-.627783C.709668-1.075419 1.020829-1.664989 1.452089-2.030741C1.632235-2.183592 1.894266-2.281854 2.085331-2.281854H2.112626C2.325526-2.270936 2.434705-2.167215 2.451082-1.970692Z\" id=\"m043_g10-51\"></path><path d=\"M2.647606-.529521L2.5