 xlink:href=\"#m043_g13-61\" y=\"-47.320367\"></use><use x=\"-33.155498\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g4-13\" y=\"-66.909399\"></use><use x=\"-33.155498\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g4-13\" y=\"-60.931815\"></use><use x=\"-28.811801\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g16-71\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"-23.944052\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g13-61\" y=\"-56.877043\"></use><use x=\"-17.035701\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g7-0\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"-8.425827\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g16-54\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"-2.653967\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g13-92\" y=\"-56.877043\"></use><use x=\"1.081327\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g10-51\" y=\"-55.744237\"></use><use x=\"6.704727\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g4-0\" y=\"-65.965429\"></use><use x=\"11.556524\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g16-53\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"15.116677\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g13-92\" y=\"-56.877043\"></use><use x=\"18.742385\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g10-52\" y=\"-55.786148\"></use><use x=\"23.571008\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g7-185\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"27.287068\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g16-71\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"32.154817\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g13-61\" y=\"-56.877043\"></use><use x=\"36.849303\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g7-186\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"40.864236\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g4-1\" y=\"-65.965429\"></use><use x=\"44.580245\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g4-13\" y=\"-66.909399\"></use><use x=\"44.580245\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g4-13\" y=\"-60.931815\"></use><use x=\"48.923911\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g20-50\" y=\"-64.102131\"></use><use x=\"48.923911\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g20-50\" y=\"-54.590604\"></use><use x=\"54.7188\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g16-150\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"79.14382\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g16-73\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"83.463621\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g13-61\" y=\"-56.877043\"></use><use x=\"90.925439\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g1-61\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"101.762504\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g16-53\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"105.322657\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g13-92\" y=\"-56.877043\"></use><use x=\"108.948365\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g10-52\" y=\"-55.786148\"></use><use x=\"113.776988\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g7-185\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"117.493048\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g16-71\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"122.360797\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g13-61\" y=\"-56.877043\"></use><use x=\"127.055283\" xlink:href=\"#m043_g7-186\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">PCA 与手工字典只能表达线性或预设结构</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Linear PCA could not capture curved data manifolds, while deep non-linear autoencoders failed to optimize from random initialization.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用深层 encoder-decoder 学非线性低维 latent 并重建输入</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Pretrain stacked RBMs greedily layer-by-layer, then unfold into a symmetric encoder–decoder fine-tuned by backpropagation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">可学习的 bottleneck 表征与逐层预训练</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Demonstrated that deep non-linear bottleneck manifolds could be stably optimized to compress high-dimensional perceptual data.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">奠定医学去噪、异常检测、压缩和 latent generative 接口</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Conceptual ancestor of medical denoising autoencoders, unsupervised anomaly detection, and latent-space compression.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">思想基础；普通 AE 的采样、不确定性和 L2 模糊有限</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Historical foundation; deterministic L2 autoencoders blur high-frequency details and lack a tractable generative sampling density.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">非线性 encoder–decoder 以重建约束学习低维 manifold，突破 PCA 的线性子空间限制。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">2006 年方案先逐层生成式预训练再展开为自编码器，解决当时深网从随机初始化难优化的问题。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">bottleneck 容量与重建误差共同定义信息压缩：过宽会学恒等映射，过窄会丢失任务相关细节。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Pretrain stacked RBMs greedily layer-by-layer, then unfold into a symmetric encoder–decoder fine-tuned by backpropagation.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Demonstrated that deep non-linear bottleneck manifolds could be stably optimized to compress high-dimensional perceptual data.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Non-Linear Bottleneck Manifold Compression via Reconstruction Minimization.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">该结构奠定医学图像去噪、压缩、缺失重建和基于重建误差的异常检测。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">低重建误差不保证临床正常，强 decoder 也可能重建异常；异常检测必须进行病种和设备分层验证。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Conceptual ancestor of medical denoising autoencoders, unsupervised anomaly detection, and latent-space compression.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Historical foundation; deterministic L2 autoencoders blur high-frequency details and lack a tractable generative sampling density.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/16873662/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Reducing the Dimensionality of Data with Neural Networks</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<span class=\"spec-muted-val\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">未提供官方实现</span><span class=\"lang-en\">No Official Repository</span></span>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
